  m_Text: "<b>[QU\u1EA2N L\xDD IDOL]:</b>\n'T\u1ED1i nay nh\u1EDB l\xEAn s\xF3ng \u0111\xFAng gi\u1EDD nh\xE9 em. Tinh th\u1EA7n th\u1EADt t\u1ED1t v\xE0o!'\n\n<b>[TR\u01AF\u1EDENG FANCLUB]:</b>\n'T\u1EE5i em \u0111\xE3 \u0111\u1EA9y top trending cho anh r\u1ED3i \u1EA1! Ch\xFAc anh bu\u1ED5i stream r\u1EF1c r\u1EE1!'\n\n<b>[NH\xC3N H\xC0NG]:</b>\n'Nh\xE3n h\xE0ng g\u1EEDi t\u1EB7ng set qu\xE0 tai nghe m\u1EDBi, ch\xFAc m\u1EEBng idol!'"
